          "text": "An orbital diagram with arrows to show conrotatory (clockwise and clockwise) movement of two p-orbitals with opposite-sign lobes pointed upward. This allows same-sign lobes to merge."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_30_02_006.jpg",
